## Notes

- The website was redesigned for mobile (February 2026) and desktop (March 2026), and the iPhone and Android apps were updated in the same period. Descriptions of an old or unchanged Riyasewana design are out of date.
- Prices are asking prices in Sri Lankan Rupees (LKR), not final sale prices.
- An ad showing "Negotiable" either had no price, or its price fell outside the statistical market range for its make, model and year. The About page explains how that range is calculated.
- Vehicle review videos from the Riyasewana YouTube channel (https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjm3xnBye4keJCmF2raTl3w) are shown in search results for the reviewed model.
